  "releaseNotes": "- BREAKING: DateTimeHelper.GetTimeByTimeSpan() moved as a TimeSpan-extension with new logic.\n- BREAKING: Removed TimeSpan.GetRelativeTimeSpan().\n- BREAKING: Removed extensions because covered by .NET:\n- ToLongDateString()\n- ToShortDateString()\n- ToLongTimeString()\n- ToShortTimeString()\n- Added IsLeapYear extension.\n- Added BeginOfYear() and EndOfYear() extension for int.\n- Added new TextGenerationHelper.\n- Added new methods long.ToDateTimeFromUnixEpoch() and DateTime.ToUnixEpoch() as extension methods.\n- Fixed bug on quarter info retrieval.\n- Several bug fixes to methods.",
